  "details": "VRC+ icons imply that only VRC+ can upload an icon\nWhat if VRC has premade icons that are whitelisted, that everyone can use, and the custom would be vrc+, so new players and streamers can have a \"I'm new\" or \"I'm streaming\" icon\n\nEdit:\nWith the ability to block icons, it would be a great example to make these as fallback and more since they are whitelisted\n\n-\"I'm new\" \n-\"I'm streaming\"\n\nit could even have further function by letting these icons be animated\n-waving hand\n-red flashing broadcast Icon\n\nIt can also be furthered into rewarding players for participating in events\nand since these whitelisted icons could be animated, these icons could not be replicated by just using custom icons",
